  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Brown bacon in a large pot over medium heat. Drain grease and place onion in the pot. Cook and stir until tender. Pour in water. Mix in bouillon cubes until dissolved. Stir in black-eyed peas; season with salt and pepper. Bring to a boil, reduce heat to low, and simmer 45 minutes.",
